      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimates\n- 500M DAU -> 58k U/s\n- 50B Msg/d ->  580k Msg/s\n- so 100 Msg/U/D\n\navg msg size (no media)\n- 100kb -> 100 Msg/U/D = 100MB U/D\navg media size\n- 10MB -> 100 Msg/U/D = 10GB/U/D",
      "fontSize": 16.07605912060515,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimates\n- 500M DAU -> 58k U/s\n- 50B Msg/d ->  580k Msg/s\n- so 100 Msg/U/D\n\navg msg size (no media)\n- 100kb -> 100 Msg/U/D = 100MB U/D\navg media size\n- 10MB -> 100 Msg/U/D = 10GB/U/D",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
