      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2IxbKM82j09iQWc0qmOVu",
      "originalText": "client stores the messages in a local DB like sqlite/indexedDB with PENDING state when offline, sends it as soon as internet is back & clears it.",
