    {
      "id": "CmdkurvgmCzdFcPDd8fiu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1077.0957340773382,
      "y": 78.52930128029593,
      "width": 392.92386045623425,
      "height": 392.30061574948394,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2067214786,
      "version": 2063,
      "versionNonce": 655295041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791824111552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User\n- userId: PK\n- email\n- phone\n...acc info...\n- groupChats: {\n    chatIds...\n  }\n\nChat\n- chatId: PK\n- memberId:[]\n\nInbox\n- recipientId\n- messageIds[]\n\nMessage\n- chatId: PK (partition key) -> shards data; all msgs of a chat live together\n- orderId: SK (sort key) -> per-chat monotonic seq; sorts the partition by order\n- messageId (unique attr, ULID)\n- clientId (idempotency/dedupe key)\n- attachmentId: FK -> Attachment\n- content\n- timestamp (client, display only)\n\nAttachment\n- attachmentId: PK\n- size\n- blobUrl\n- expiry: default 30 days\n- status: UPLOADING/SUCCESS/ERROR/SENT",
      "fontSize": 9.807515393737098,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User\n- userId: PK\n- email\n- phone\n...acc info...\n- groupChats: {\n    chatIds...\n  }\n\nChat\n- chatId: PK\n- memberId:[]\n\nInbox\n- recipientId\n- messageIds[]\n\nMessage\n- chatId: PK (partition key) -> shards data; all msgs of a chat live together\n- orderId: SK (sort key) -> per-chat monotonic seq; sorts the partition by order\n- messageId (unique attr, ULID)\n- clientId (idempotency/dedupe key)\n- attachmentId: FK -> Attachment\n- content\n- timestamp (client, display only)\n\nAttachment\n- attachmentId: PK\n- size\n- blobUrl\n- expiry: default 30 days\n- status: UPLOADING/SUCCESS/ERROR/SENT",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
