      "updated": 1791824100015,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- ordering on orderId (SK) = per-chat monotonic\nseq assigned server-side on persist; client\ntimestamp is display-only (not the sort key)\n\n- messages reference chatId to map which\nmessage of user A->B goes where.\n(they can have many chats)\n\n- idempotency (dedupe) on clientId so that double\nsend doesn't happen",
      "fontSize": 10.8586173387644,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- ordering on orderId (SK) = per-chat monotonic seq assigned server-side on persist; client timestamp is display-only (not the sort key)\n\n- messages reference chatId to map which message of user A->B goes where.\n(they can have many chats)\n\n- idempotency (dedupe) on clientId so that double\nsend doesn't happen",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
